<title>USA: ALPINE SKIING-LEADING RESULTS OF GIANT SLALOM FIRST RUN.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-LEADING RESULTS OF GIANT SLALOM FIRST RUN.</headline>
<dateline>PARK CITY, Utah 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading results in the</p>
<p>first run of the men's World Cup giant slalom at Park City,</p>
<p>Utah, on Monday:</p>
<p>1. Josef Strobl (Austria) 1 minute 15.25 seconds</p>
<p>2. Michael Von Gruenigen (Switzerland) 1:15.77</p>
<p>3. Matteo Nana (Italy) 1:15.96</p>
<p>4. Hermann Maier (Austria) 1:15.99</p>
<p>5. Achim Vogt (Liechtenstein) 1:16.05</p>
<p>6. Johan Wallner (Sweden) 1:16.12</p>
<p>7. Hans Knaus (Austria) 1:16.13</p>
<p>8. Fredrik Nyberg (Sweden) 1:16.14</p>
<p>9. Thomas Grandi (Canada) 1:16.15</p>
<p>10. Urs Kaelin (Switzerland) 1:16.16</p>
</text>
